# Combined corrections selection v1 — scoped integration review

**Verdict: `ACCEPT-DESIGN-UNIT`**

Not pristine-blind. Not a Claude-agreement claim. Frozen/live/history untouched. This is packaging of already-reviewed code so a strict verifier can accept it. It is not whole-M1 completion and does not activate the live lock.

